<p>Attached: <strong>POW_SYSTEMS_DEV_REFERENCE_2026-09-20.zip</strong></p>
<p>This is the coding reference for splitting POW into independently deploy=
able gardens while preserving shared typed contracts.</p>
<p>Included:</p>
<ul>
<li>system ranking + build order</li>
<li>strict POW/Muse boundary</li>
<li>shared Observation / DerivedFact / EconomicEvent / rights contracts</li=
>
